            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Crash"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Instead of sugar, I like to use two tablespoons of natural honey. I also added 2 tbsp of melted butter in with the egg white after beating. I barely sprinked it with sea salt and Saigon cinnamon before cooking.",
            "datePublished": "2016-07-10T21:12:01.427Z"
