              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ashley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are so good! I followed the many other reviews and substituted the water for vanilla extract. I also did 1/4 c brown sugar and 1/4 c white sugar instead of 1/2 c white sugar. They turned out exactly how I imagined. They remind me of the ones I would buy at a carnival.",
