              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joanne Hoschette"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this recipe 9 times one Christmas. The reviews are spot on. I too made the changes many other reviewers made. I used 1/4 C. Dark brown sugar &amp; 1/4 C. Sugar in the Raw.( my grown daughters tweek) I too use vanilla insteàd of water. I also use 1 1/4 C. Walnuts &amp; 1 1/4 C. Pecans. All pecans are GREAT in this recipe. However I use half walnuts B/C they are far less expensive AND healthier .. I also do a diabetic version, as another reviewer did I(we) use splenda and splenda brown sugar. Actually that version is my favorite.\nWonderful as a gift.,on salads and healthy snacking...one after another and another....WOW.",
